{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgPLtkRzNPjtkWrrPP8bX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The data don't support the hypothesis that more remote work raises innovation. My conclusion is **no effect**.\n\n- **Raw correlation:** A simple regression of 2023 patents per 100 engineers on remote share gives a strongly positive estimate: +1.60 patents per standard deviation of remote share (p ≈ 1e-11). That correlation is confounded. Larger, older and more patent-heavy firms do more remote work, and those same traits predict more patents.\n- **Preferred estimate:** With the full set of 2020 firm characteristics as controls, the estimate is −0.275 patents per 100 engineers per standard deviation of remote share. The standard error is 0.239 and the p-value is 0.249. The 95% confidence interval is roughly −0.74 to +0.19. Any positive effect is therefore small, under about 0.2 patents per 100 engineers, against an outcome standard deviation of 10.9.\n- **Other specifications:** Adding only the three core controls, adding a segment interaction, using the log of patents, and adding a squared term all gave small, non-significant effects. I did not find any nonlinearity.\n- **Collaboration index:** I left out `collab_index_2023` from the preferred model. It is measured after remote work began, so controlling for it would bias the estimate. Including it gives −2.89, which is likely an artifact, and I report it only for transparency.\n- **Causal caveat:** This is cross-sectional observational data. A causal reading depends on the controls capturing all the confounding.\n\nI estimated seven specifications in total, and the report lists all of them.\n\nFiles are in the working folder:\n- report.md\n- final_answer.json"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":764,"cache_read_input_tokens":13405,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":764,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":541,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1a1c6164-fec1-40db-a296-df7265b54cde","uuid":"b9968fe8-84d9-4829-8e21-237f75e95ae8"}
